        {
          "id": 2156591610,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "We don't use [__builtin_available](https://clang.llvm.org/docs/LanguageExtensions.html#objective-c-available) anywhere, so I'm assuming we don't need this.",
          "author": {
            "id": 860017,
            "username": "geraldcombs",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Gerald Combs",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/860017/avatar.png?v=1789689689",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/geraldcombs"
          },
          "created_at": "2024-10-13T22:11:38.381Z",
          "updated_at": "2024-10-13T22:11:38.381Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 249847113,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 12029,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 2156594852,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> We don't use [\\__builtin_available](https://clang.llvm.org/docs/LanguageExtensions.html#objective-c-available) anywhere, so I'm assuming we don't need this.\n\nWe may someday do so, now that Apple finally responded to my prodding and went with weak linking as of the Sequoia libpcap, but that may have to wait until we can rely on weak linking on older platforms, which may not be until Sequoia is the oldest version we support.",
          "author": {
            "id": 5636682,
            "username": "guyharris",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Guy Harris",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1b7c243a9b1d6587a9a9067e5d83aba1e87212df7c4eeae3690f791ecbe4675a?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/guyharris"
          },
